{"schema": "gce.chatgpt.normalized.v1", "conversation_id": "6aa32d59-d38c-83e8-9081-d91f4210022c", "title": "Cancel Albert", "canonical_url": "https://chatgpt.com/c/6aa32d59-d38c-83e8-9081-d91f4210022c", "project_id": null, "create_time": 1789078875.261493, "update_time": 1790295614.71257, "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6", "is_archived": false, "is_temporary_chat": false, "context_truncation_continuation": null, "turn_count": 38, "role_counts": {"assistant": 23, "user": 11, "system": 1, "tool": 3}, "turns": [{"message_id": "609c1bd1-ef9c-476f-b5c9-be1e8291994d", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789078865.835678, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Reminder: **Cancel Albert today and verify there are no additional or pending charges.**", "text_chars": 88, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "c3957d43-82e9-4a4c-88d2-06921188a7d8", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790233625.210573, "updated_at": 1790233635.114256, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer", "text"], "text": "We're waiting on this money to clear Albert so we could cancel on it. This is taking forever. These people are ridiculous.", "text_chars": 122, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer"]}, {"message_id": "060e1ebb-f7a1-48f2-aeb0-c34f3b071c3c", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790233627.456852, "updated_at": 1790233634.838898, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yeah — this screenshot explains the holdup.\n\nThe **$11 Auto Save from September 17 is still “IN PROGRESS.”** Albert says the bank has already received the request, but it’s sitting at **Processing → “Waiting for your bank to complete your transfer.”** Their displayed estimate is **5–6 business days, excluding weekends and holidays**.\n\nGiven it was initiated Thursday **9/17**, the business-day count is roughly: Fri 9/18 = day 1, Mon 9/21 = 2, Tue = 3, Wed = 4, **Thu 9/24 = 5**, Fri 9/25 = 6. So as ridiculous as the elapsed week feels, **today/tomorrow is actually the end of Albert's stated window**.\n\nI would **not cancel the account while this $11 is unresolved**. Once it changes to completed and you verify the $11 landed where expected, then we can kill Albert and verify **(1)** membership canceled, **(2)** Auto Save disabled, **(3)** no pending transfers, and **(4)** no pending/subsequent Albert charges.\n\nAnd yes, this is exactly the loose end we were worried about before closing Albert. memcite", "text_chars": 1013, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "5f37825f-dadd-4695-a3f3-62beb85d3f2b", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790233627.4581773, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "model_editable_context", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "35125eb8-518a-4682-923c-b6b74320e8ae", "role": "system", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790233629.195105, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 0, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "